From: aurelex <aurelex@localhost>
Date: Sun, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dsl: drop unused QSvgRenderer include

The LTE/DSL reader never uses QSvgRenderer (the include is dead code; the
only Svg references are qrc:/// icon URLs, not symbols). Upstream compiles
with QtSvg available, but our Android carve links Core/Xml/Concurrent/Gui
only (design D1), so this include was failing to find <QSvgRenderer>.
Removing an unused include is behavior-neutral.

---
 src/dict/dsl.cc | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/dict/dsl.cc b/src/dict/dsl.cc
index eb514e68..55cf0ae5 100644
--- a/src/dict/dsl.cc
+++ b/src/dict/dsl.cc
@@ -30,7 +30,6 @@
 #include <QPainter>
 #include <QRegularExpression>
 #include <QByteArray>
-#include <QSvgRenderer>
 #include <QtConcurrentRun>
 #include "utils.hh"
 #include "common/globalbroadcaster.hh"
--
2.30.0